# Leave unset to serve mock data from lib/mock. Set to the API origin to go live.
DG_API_URL=
# Public origin of the site. A production build fails unless this starts with https://
# (it is also the host used in the canonical URLs, sitemap and robots.txt).
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://defencegatehub.com
# Escape hatch for local previews of a production build only: lets the build run with
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL unset. Never set it in a real deployment.
# DG_ALLOW_INSECURE_SITE_URL=1
#
# lib/deadline.ts can pin "now" for local demos and screenshots through a NEXT_PUBLIC_ variable.
# It is for local demos only, is deliberately not listed here, and must not be set in production.
